1433606	⟩⟩<note n="1" c=" From the Akkadian in KUB 4.63 II obv. 9′ we simply expect &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;UTU&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;-uš&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Hittite&gt;. The sign &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN&gt;EŠ&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SIGN&gt; immediately follows -uš. &lt;SP_f_AO_3a_Determ&gt;D&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_Determ&gt;&lt;SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt;30&lt;/SP_f_AO_3a_SumGRAM&gt; is a common writing for the moon god, but what this is supposed to do here is uncelar to me."/>
